      "id": "king-henry-the-fifth/sceneIV_11.4/p@132126",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "PISTOL.\nO, Signieur Dew should be a gentleman.\nPerpend my words, O Signieur Dew, and mark:\nO Signieur Dew, thou diest on point of fox,\nExcept, O signieur, thou do give to me\nEgregious ransom.",
